Map data of the InfraFence WHM plugin
=====================================

world.json
  Country outlines from Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com), 1:110m Admin 0
  countries, version 4.1.0. Natural Earth data is in the public domain.
  Converted from world-atlas 2.0.2 (https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas), projected with
  d3-geo 3.1.1 and topojson-client 3.1.0 by dev/world-map/generate.mjs.

